00:06:18.243 --> 00:06:20.710
Also, something you really,
really have to think about

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.580
is it's not just about
consuming cups of water.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.640
When you eat fruit, there's
water intake in there.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:27.360
You drink tea, there's water in there.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.300
You even drink soda, even
though I'm not a fan,

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:30.250
there's water in there.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.570
You're hydrating yourself.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.670
So you have to take all of
that into consideration.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.570
Then the way that I would tell my patients

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:38.530
to judge whether or not
they're well hydrated

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.350
is through their pee.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.708
If your pee is really dark
in color withstanding...

00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:44.920
Withstanding? Withoutstanding?

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.620
Notwithstanding having a medical illness.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:48.300
If you're completely healthy
in your urine's dark,

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.950
that means you could
use more water intake.

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:52.400
If your urine is clear all the time,

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.010
maybe you don't need
to be drinking so much

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.010
because you're overdrinking,

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.460
'cause the ideal urine
color that you wanna aim for

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.740
is like a pale, straw-colored yellow.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:02.400
And if it's that all the time,
you're doing a great job.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:05.230
Know that when you're
exercising, especially in heat,

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.063
you need more water.

00:07:06.063 --> 00:07:08.350
Know that if you have a
fever, you need more water.

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:09.960
Know that if you're just
sitting at home all day,

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:11.460
maybe you don't need as much water

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:12.890
as when you are exercising.

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:14.190
All things to keep in mind.

