00:07:37.547 --> 00:07:39.767
"Is it necessary for the Gatorade to work

00:07:39.767 --> 00:07:40.770
"or is it to taste good?"

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.400
Gatorade is a sports drink.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:45.000
It's meant to be consumed
during intense exercise

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:45.930
when two things are happening:

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:48.050
you're burning a ton of calories
and you're sweating a lot.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.051
What do you need to do?

00:07:49.051 --> 00:07:50.040
You need to replace those calories

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.370
and you need to replace your electrolytes.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.170
Gatorade has both of those
ingredients in there.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:56.660
When you actively run,
punch, lift weights,

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.150
what you're doing is
you're burning the sugar

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:59.760
that is actually in your muscles,

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.560
and that sugar needs to be repleted,

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.520
and we do so by consuming Gatorade.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:05.110
Now, if you're a person
just sitting on the couch

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.910
playing a video game and
you're drinking Gatorade,

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:09.360
you're essentially taking all
that sugar and just storing it

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:12.160
and not actively using
it, so it can be a source

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.230
of unnecessary weight
gain for individuals.

